EXTERNAL Name(charname)

{Name("Jesse")}
Well, I say a bartender as good as you don’t come around all that often. This here drink is amazing!

{Name("Rana")}
Haha, thanks!

{Name("Jesse")}
An-...

{Name("Rana")}
Uh. You good?

{Name("Jesse")}
I’m sorry, what am I even doing.

{Name("Rana")}
What happened to your accent?

{Name("Jesse")}
Why am I even walking around with a cadaverifier threatening my friend?

{Name("Rana")}
Uh. I’m confused.

{Name("Jesse")}
Maybe, by trying to cling onto something that’s gone, we’re hurting what we still got?

{Name("Rana")}
Listen man, I just work here.

{Name("Jesse")}
I’m done trying to play this part. It’s time to move on!

{Name("Rana")}
…

{Name("Rana")}
But.

{Name("Jesse")}
Thank you for bestowing your wisdom upon me, wise gnome! I now take my leave.